  "description": "Lee Seo-woo, the Imoogi who lost his parents when he was young and was raised by tigers. It's been 10 years since I started training in the human world to fulfill my long-held wish to ascend to the dragon, but the end of training is rarely seen. Meanwhile, the couple's amazing cohabitation begins when an old friend, Beom Ji-ho, suddenly comes to visit and says he will take him back to Taebaek...?\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000068097)",
